  "prefLabel": "Jus 1509.03 Public Disclosure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1509.03 Public Disclosure. The registers referred to in Jus 1509.01(a)(1), (a)(2), and (b)(1) shall be subject to disclosure under RSA 91-A. Other records maintained in accordance with this part shall be disclosable to the public unless exempt pursuant to RSA 91-A, but this section shall not be construed as altering the application of RSA 91-A to such records.\n\nSource. #8082, eff 5-8-04\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus1500.html"
}
